──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ARCHITECTURE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- Single HTML file with embedded CSS + JS
- Separate sw.js for service worker
- Separate manifest.json for PWA metadata
- No external dependencies whatsoever
- Screen-based SPA navigation with CSS transitions
- Module pattern: SM-2, State, UI, Navigation, Features
- Data: 65 vocabulary words, 9 lessons, 12 speaking phrases
- LocalStorage persistence for all user data

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
LEARNING SYSTEM
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- SM-2 spaced repetition with quality-based reviews
- Multi-modal learning: reading, listening, speaking, writing
- Progressive lesson unlock (sequential A1 → A2 → B1)
- Daily goal with streak reinforcement
- XP rewards: Word=10, Flashcard=5, Quiz correct=10, Lesson=50
- Level progression every 100 XP
- Achievement unlocks for milestone moments
- Pronunciation history tracking

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VOCABULARY DATABASE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- 65 carefully chosen German words/phrases
- All with: German, romanization, Arabic, category, difficulty, emoji, 2 example sentences
- 8 categories covering real-life domains
- Difficulty distribution: Easy (40%), Medium (45%), Hard (15%)

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
APPLE HIG COMPLIANCE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- SF Pro font stack via system-ui
- 44x44px minimum touch targets throughout
- Safe area insets (notch + home indicator)
- Glassmorphism: blur(20px) + saturate(180%) on header/nav
- iOS scroll bounce via -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch
- Spring animations: cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) ease-out
- Dark mode optimized (OLED-black #0a0a0f background)
- Status bar spacer for Dynamic Island compatibility
- Tap highlight removed via -webkit-tap-highlight-color
- Modal bottom sheets with drag handle
- Improved spring easing for premium feel (NEW)

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PWA SCORE
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- Installable via manifest.json
- Offline capable via service worker
- Cache-first strategy for all assets
- beforeinstallprompt handled
- App metadata: name, description, icons, categories
- Supports standalone display mode

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ACCESSIBILITY
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- Semantic HTML (nav, button, header elements)
- RTL layout for Arabic UI (dir="rtl")
- LTR direction on German text (direction:ltr)
- ARIA labels on all icon-only buttons (NEW)
- ARIA roles: tablist, tab, dialog, document (NEW)
- aria-selected state on nav items (NEW)
- aria-live polite on toast (NEW)
- aria-modal on dialogs (NEW)
- Skip link for keyboard users (NEW)
- Focus management with trapFocus() (NEW)
- Focus-visible outlines on all interactive elements (NEW)
- Reduced motion support (prefers-reduced-motion) (NEW)
- Screen reader: sr-only utility class (NEW)
- Keyboard navigation: Space/Arrow keys for flashcards, Escape for modal
- Alt+1-5 nav shortcuts (NEW)
- Color contrast: text on dark backgrounds exceeds 4.5:1
- Touch targets all >=44x44px

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OFFLINE SUPPORT
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
- 100% offline capable (no CDN, no API calls)
- Service worker caches core assets on first load
- State persisted to localStorage on every change
- State recovered on page reload
- Speech synthesis uses browser native API (works offline on most devices)

